e; GCC Regional Cooperation; Conferences and Workshops', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/40140/', '280', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (136, 'MOU - Arabian Gulf University', 'MOU between Arabian Gulf University and the University of Bahrain to publish UoB master’s and doctoral theses on AGUsoft and enhance the dissemination of GCC university research outputs. Key provisions include publishing UoB postgraduate theses on the AGUsoft platform; providing technical services to prepare theses in searchable electronic form; creating a databank with thesis fields and keywords; enabling access to abstracts and full-text downloads; linking the platform to relevant academic and research institutions; supporting access to Gulf university research outputs; and enabling future cooperation to promote research ideas and development.', 'Memorandum of Understanding / MOU', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-281', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2024-02-26', '2028-02-25', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Research Dissemination; Graduate Studies; Thesis Publication; Digital Repository; Knowledge Sharing; GCC Academic Cooperation', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/%D8%AC%D8%A7%D9%85%D8%B9%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D9%84%D9%8A%D8%AC-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%B1%D8%A8%D9%8A-%D9%88%D8%AC%D8%A7%D9%85%D8%B9%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%AD%D8%B1%D9%8A%D9%86-%D8%AA%D9%88/?lang=ar', '281', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (137, 'MOU - Royal University for Women', 'MOU between the University of Bahrain and the Royal University for Women to support academic cooperation and community partnership. Key provisions include exchanging academic expertise through faculty teaching under part-time arrangements; exchanging external examiners for programme evaluation; cooperation in training and professional development through workshops and training courses for academic and administrative staff; joint scientific research projects; organizing and hosting international conferences and local seminars; and cooperation in student activities, competitions, events and artistic, cultural and sports student clubs.', 'Memorandum of Understanding / MOU', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-282', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2024-03-12', '2026-03-11', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Academic Cooperation; Faculty Exchange; External Examiners; Training and Professional Development; Research Collaboration; Student Activities', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/%D8%AA%D9%82%D8%B6%D9%8A-%D8%A8%D8%AA%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%AF%D9%84-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%A8%D8%B1%D8%A7%D8%AA-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D9%83%D8%A7%D8%AF%D9%8A%D9%85%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D9%88%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%85/?lang=ar', '282', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (138, 'MOU - Lancaster University', 'MOU between the University of Bahrain and Lancaster University to facilitate academic collaboration and cultural co-operation. Key provisions include continued dialogue among staff and students on areas of mutual academic interest; identifying potential research opportunities and initiatives; dissemination of information and experience; exchange of staff, students and researchers for teaching, study and academic research; exchange of academic publications and information; joint research, publications and academic activities; participation in conferences, academic meetings and joint exhibitions; and potential future staff/student exchange or collaborative programmes under separate agreements.', 'Memorandum of Understanding / MOU', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-283', NULL, 'INTERNATIONAL', '2024-03-22', '2027-03-21', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Academic Collaboration; Cultural Cooperation; Research Collaboration; Staff and Student Exchange; Joint Research; Conferences and Academic Meetings', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/41435/', '283', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (148, 'Service Agreement - STC Bahrain Service Agreement', 'Service Agreement between STC Bahrain B.S.C. (Closed), the University of Bahrain, and Kingdom Building Painting Construction. STC supports UoB by renovating a lecture hall at the University of Bahrain, including hall renovation and advanced audiovisual/branding elements, in return for naming and advertising rights for the hall during the 15-year term. The Contractor carries out the renovation works subject to UoB approval; the hall is to be named “STC Bahrain Hall” / “stc Hall” or another STC-approved name subject to UoB approval.', 'Service Agreement', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-293', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2025-07-27', '2040-07-27', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Corporate Sponsorship; Educational Infrastructure; Hall Renovation; Branding and Advertising Rights; CSR; Student Learning Environment', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/in-collaboration-with-stc-bahrain-launch-of-the-newly-renovated-stc-hall-at-the-college-of-arts-university-of-bahrain/', '293', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (139, 'MOU - Accounting and Auditing Organization for Islamic Financial Institutions (AAOIFI)', 'MOU between the University of Bahrain and the Accounting and Auditing Organization for Islamic Financial Institutions (AAOIFI) to support mutual cooperation in Islamic banking and finance. Key provisions include possible UoB institutional membership in AAOIFI; joint seminars, events and workshops; public hearings and awareness activities; considering AAOIFI CIPA and CSAA programmes within BSc and MSc programmes; up to 70% discount on CIPA and CSAA fellowships for UoB faculty, alumni and students of Islamic finance; strengthening UoB Islamic finance offerings based on AAOIFI standards; participation of UoB officials in AAOIFI subcommittees, working groups and technical boards; feedback on AAOIFI exposure drafts through the Sustainable Islamic Business and Finance Research Center; information exchange; and contribution of research papers/technical articles to JOIFA.', 'Memorandum of Understanding / MOU', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-284', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2024-04-28', '2027-04-27', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Islamic Finance; Accounting and Auditing Standards; Professional Certification; Capacity Building; Standards Development; Research Collaboration', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/41494/', '284', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (140, 'Agreement - Boston University', 'Agreement between the University of Bahrain and the Trustees of Boston University, acting through Boston University Wheelock College of Education and Human Development, to provide educational services through master’s programmes for Bahrain Teachers College students. Key provisions include delivery of the EdM in Educational Leadership & Policy Studies and the EdM in Curriculum & Teaching; programme materials and application processing through BU Wheelock; collaboration with UoB/BTC on approvals, student eligibility and cohort arrangements; programme delivery in English via distance learning; possible visits by BU Wheelock faculty to Bahrain; programme evaluation; and continuation of prior enrolled students and obligations under the agreement.', 'Educational Services Agreement', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-285', NULL, 'INTERNATIONAL', '2024-05-20', '2027-05-19', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Educational Services; Teacher Education; Graduate Programmes; Educational Leadership; Curriculum and Teaching; Professional Development; Distance Learning', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/39988/', '285', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (141, 'Framework Agreement - Royal Humanitarian Foundation (RHF)', 'Framework agreement between the University of Bahrain and the Royal Humanitarian Foundation to support cooperation in scientific, research and community-service fields. Key provisions include exchanging expertise and support in line with each party''s capacities; supporting knowledge dissemination, research and scientific publishing, competitions and awards in humanitarian fields; organizing joint events such as conferences, seminars, lectures and training/workshops; giving priority to registering the Foundation''s sponsored children and applicants from needy families at the University of Bahrain according to applicable rules; appointing coordinators from both parties; maintaining confidentiality; and agreeing that any future financial commitments must be separately agreed.', 'Framework Agreement / إطار عمل', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-286', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2024-05-21', '2027-05-20', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Humanitarian Cooperation; Community Service; Research Collaboration; Knowledge Dissemination; Student Support; Conferences and Training', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/42058/', '286', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (142, 'MOU - Bahrain Society of Engineers', 'MOU between the University of Bahrain and the Bahrain Society of Engineers to enhance cooperation in the engineering field and support the engineering sector in Bahrain. Key provisions include organizing conferences and workshops on mutually agreed topics; seeking sponsorship and financial support for conferences; organizing specialized seminars and lectures involving faculty from the Colleges of Engineering and Information Technology; providing lists of arbitrators, trainers and consultants for scientific events and competitions/exhibitions; using specialists from the Society for teaching engineering and IT expertise when needed; forming joint work teams for specialized studies; exchanging information related to universities, colleges, institutes and engineering societies; announcing joint conferences and workshops through each party’s channels; providing free seats for each party in engineering conferences; promoting society membership for UoB engineering students; dedicating an award for best graduation project; and providing a free booth for the Society in the University career fair.', 'Memorandum of Understanding / MOU', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-287', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2024-06-09', '2028-06-08', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Engineering Cooperation; Conferences and Workshops; Training and Professional Development; Faculty Expertise; Student Support; Professional Membership; Graduation Projects; Career Fair', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', 'https://www.uob.edu.bh/%D8%AC%D8%A7%D9%85%D8%B9%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%AD%D8%B1%D9%8A%D9%86-%D9%88%D8%AC%D9%85%D8%B9%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%87%D9%86%D8%AF%D8%B3%D9%8A%D9%86-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%AD%D8%B1/?lang=ar', '287', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
