uob.edu.bh/delegation-from-sultan-qaboos-university-visits-university-of-bahrain/', '288', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (144, 'Cooperation Agreement - Ministry of Oil and Environment / Water Resource Management Unit', 'Cooperation Agreement between the Ministry of Oil and Environment, represented by the Water Resource Management Unit, and the University of Bahrain for the Green Climate Fund project titled “Comprehensive Water Use Audit for all non-municipal sectors, with an assessment for water use in the municipal sector.” Key provisions include UoB performing consultancy services, following approved methodology and standards, reporting progress, conducting scoping assessments, establishing water-use inventories, assessing technology needs, implementing metering and monitoring plans, reviewing maintenance practices, developing action plans, documenting best practices, assessing municipal-sector water use, and preparing a water service sector proposal.', 'Cooperation Agreement / Consultancy Services Agreement', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-289', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2024-07-15', '2026-07-14', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Water Resource Management; Climate Resilience; Sustainability; Comprehensive Water Use Audit; Environmental Research; Consultancy Services', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', NULL, '289', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.agreements (agreement_id, title, description, agreement_type, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at, agreement_code, title_ar, geographic_scope, start_date, end_date, effective_date, signing_date, auto_renew, renewal_term_months, non_renewal_notice_months, termination_notice_months, responsible_unit_id, need_justification, expected_value, objectives, focus_areas, collaboration_areas, implementation_methods, financial_commitments, financial_amount, financial_currency, financial_description, human_resources_commitments, human_resources_description, training_programs, training_programs_description, annual_report_required, monitoring_plan, confidentiality_terms, intellectual_property_terms, compliance_terms, relationship_disclaimer, amendment_terms, dispute_resolution_terms, other_terms, legal_binding_status, signing_link, source_record_id, activated_at, expired_at) OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES (145, 'Memorandum of Cooperation and Cooperation Agreement - St Christopher’s School Bahrain', 'Memorandum of Cooperation and related Cooperation Agreement between the University of Bahrain/Confucius Institute and St Christopher’s School Bahrain to strengthen Chinese language teaching and cultural exchange. Key provisions include Chinese language teaching and related cultural activities at St Christopher’s School; evaluation of Chinese language education; other academic exchange and cooperation programmes approved by both parties; signing specific project agreements before implementation; Confucius Institute providing two teachers for four hours of Chinese instruction per week; curriculum approved by the Confucius Institute and tailored to students’ needs; and payment/invoicing procedures for the school-based Chinese language courses.', 'Memorandum of Cooperation / Cooperation Agreement', 'ACTIVE', 1, '2026-05-10 17:02:39', '2026-07-26 16:57:20.16977', 'UOB-AGR-290', NULL, 'LOCAL', '2024-12-03', '2027-07-14', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chinese Language Education; Cultural Exchange; School Collaboration; Confucius Institute; Educational Services', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'BHD', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NON_BINDING', NULL, '290', NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
